# Manual requests for the Goldfish API. Keys are sent only over HTTPS.
# Set apiKey to a development key whose SHA-256 hash is in user secrets (see docs/pricing-rules.md).
@host = https://localhost:7258
@apiKey = replace-with-a-development-key
@policyId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@etag = "AAAAAAAAAAA="
@quoteId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create a policy (policies:write). Copy the returned id and ETag header.
POST {{host}}/api/policies
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyType": "Commercial",
  "coverageLimit": 2000000,
  "basePrice": 1234.57
}

### Get a policy (policies:read)
GET {{host}}/api/policies/{{policyId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Update a policy (policies:write). If-Match must be the current ETag; a stale one returns 412.
PUT {{host}}/api/policies/{{policyId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
If-Match: {{etag}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyType": "Commercial",
  "coverageLimit": 2000000,
  "basePrice": 1300.00
}

### Request a quote (quotes:create). CUJ 1 expects final price 1851.86 with the initial rule set.
POST {{host}}/api/policies/{{policyId}}/quotes
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Read a saved quote (quotes:read)
GET {{host}}/api/quotes/{{quoteId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Active pricing version (pricing:read)
GET {{host}}/api/pricing/active-version
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Sample products endpoint (anonymous)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Goldfish food",
  "price": 4.99
}
